config BR2_PACKAGE_Q2PKGD
	bool "q2pkgd"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_SQUASHFS
	select BR2_PACKAGE_SQUASHFS_LZO # mtd2's images are LZO; mksquashfs refuses to append to one without it
	select BR2_PACKAGE_Q2_MBEDTLS # download's HTTPS
	help
	  Vamp OS's update service (pkgd/, docs/pkgd.md): a release checked against the release key,
	  composed with this Q2's vendor set by the image's own mksquashfs, and staged for Shanling's
	  recovery, or downloaded from the release feed into the card's .vamp/os/ for the next card
	  boot. It never writes flash.
